# Spec 057 (area-light geometry), generated by specs/057-area-light-geometry/tools/gen_scenes.py: do not edit.
# AreaLight_EmitterClassicLight (lit, reyes): the vee of AreaLight_EmitterPixels (al_surface_matte, Color [0.8, 0.4, 0.2]) bound to the shipped arealight and a distantlight
# (handle 2, intensity 1, shining along +z) on the camera side. Each leaf receives the classic light: pixel = Cs * intensity * (Nf . L) = Cs * cos 30 deg
# = [0.692820323027551, 0.3464101615137755, 0.17320508075688776], and is not changed by being an emitter: the two variants are byte-identical images, and the probes pin the value.
version 3.03
Hider "reyes" "jitter" [0]
PixelSamples 1 1
PixelFilter "box" 1 1
Quantize "rgba" 0 0 0 0
